# Scene 5: one line, nine axes. The home page's axes table: pressing a row plays the bug that axis catches. Recorded against the landing branch's build served
# on 127.0.0.1:8765 (README.md).
Import //reels/entities.reelpreset
Open http://127.0.0.1:8765/index.html#questions

Output //.artifacts/reel/scenes/05-axes.mp4
Set Browser chromium
Set Viewport 1440x1040
Set WaitTimeout 20s

Hide
Wait css:"#qtable"
Sleep 1500ms
Show
Say "That one line asks every rule nine questions. Each one a kind of production bug."
Say@over "Invariant: [q1] a step that lets a negative price in."
Wait [q1]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(1) .qbtn"
Say@over "Idempotency: [q2] a retry that changes things twice."
Wait [q2]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(2) .qbtn"
Say@skeptic "A retry that charges the card twice. I've shipped that one."
Say@over "Monotonicity: [q3] an older result overwriting a newer one. Conservation: [q4] a fee, and money vanishes."
Wait [q3]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(3) .qbtn"
Wait [q4]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(4) .qbtn"
Say@over "Absence: [q5] a cancelled order that still ships. Temporal: [q6] shipped at ninety seconds, promised within sixty."
Wait [q5]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(5) .qbtn"
Wait [q6]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(6) .qbtn"
Scroll down 4 css:"#qtable"
Say@over "Liveness: [q7] the spinner that never stops. Confluence: [q8] a label that depends on the order lines arrived in."
Wait [q7]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(7) .qbtn"
Wait [q8]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(8) .qbtn"
Say@over "And vacancy, [q9] the one nobody asks: a green test that never reached the rule. Here that fails. [done]"
Wait [q9]
Click css:"#qtable tbody tr:nth-child(9) .qbtn"
Wait [done]
Sleep 600ms

